{"verse_key": "10:85", "surah": 10, "verse": 85, "text_uthmani": "فَقَالُوا۟ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ تَوَكَّلْنَا رَبَّنَا لَا تَجْعَلْنَا فِتْنَةً لِّلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "So they said, \"Upon Allāh do we rely. Our Lord, make us not [objects of] trial for the wrongdoing people", "verse_from_ms": 1859830, "verse_to_ms": 1871640, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَقَالُوا۟", "start_ms": 1859830, "end_ms": 1861170}, {"i": 1, "text": "عَلَى", "start_ms": 1861170, "end_ms": 1861560}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 1861560, "end_ms": 1862330}, {"i": 3, "text": "تَوَكَّلْنَا", "start_ms": 1862330, "end_ms": 1863760}, {"i": 4, "text": "رَبَّنَا", "start_ms": 1863760, "end_ms": 1864750}, {"i": 5, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1864750, "end_ms": 1865080}, {"i": 6, "text": "تَجْعَلْنَا", "start_ms": 1865080, "end_ms": 1866260}, {"i": 7, "text": "فِتْنَةً", "start_ms": 1866260, "end_ms": 1867150}, {"i": 8, "text": "لِّلْقَوْمِ", "start_ms": 1867150, "end_ms": 1868240}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "start_ms": 1868240, "end_ms": 1871085}]}